{"id":"19864c2706f56675","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyEval.md","title":"PolyEval","display":"PolyEval","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyEval","parameters":["d","g","t","r"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyEval"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>d</span><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>r</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 类型判断与独立算法。有序参数：<code>d</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>r</code>。</p>\n<p>五分支后序类型综合，包含失败分支；不调用 PolyType。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyEval d g t r)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z1966 (@ PolyEvalProof d g t r z1966))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eab9ec5c2a491c65\" href=\"?note=eab9ec5c2a491c65\" title=\"ZFC_PolyEvalProof\">PolyEvalProof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyEval d g t r)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PolyEvalProof","status":"resolved","id":"eab9ec5c2a491c65","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_PolyEvalProof|PolyEvalProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":813,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6df37cab7bc6f11","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyEval|PolyEval]]"},{"id":"ac0d7af354f31240","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Fail|Fail]]；[[ZFC_PolyEval|PolyEval]]；[[ZFC_PolyInput|PolyInput]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-550","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_PolyEval|PolyEval]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","eab9ec5c2a491c65","593f9bdab4d60707"]}